{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2022-11-30 17:45:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY (NYSE:CPB) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON CAMPBELL'S CAPITAL STOCK OF $0.37 PER SHARE. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE JAN. 30, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS AS OF JAN. 5, 2023."}